  "question": {
    "text": "In triangle $\\mathrm{ABC}, \\mathrm{a}=2, \\mathrm{~b}=3$ and $\\sin \\mathrm{A}=\\frac{2}{3}$, then $\\mathrm{B}$ is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
