    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $\\frac{a}{\\sin A}=\\frac{b}{\\sin B}$\n$\\sin B=\\frac{b}{a} \\cdot \\sin A=\\frac{3}{2} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=1$\n$$\n\\mathrm{B}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\n$$"
  }
